<aside data-google-analytics-target="banner"
       class="fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 z-50 mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-2xl sm:flex sm:items-center sm:gap-6"
       role="dialog"
       aria-labelledby="analytics-consent-title"
       hidden>
  <div class="flex-1">
    <h2 id="analytics-consent-title" class="text-base font-bold text-ink">Métricas de uso</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">
      Usamos cookies opcionais do Google Analytics para entender como a loja é utilizada. Carrinho, conta e pedidos não são monitorados.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-4 flex shrink-0 gap-3 sm:mt-0">
    <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink hover:border-slate-500" data-action="google-analytics#decline">
      Recusar
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-700" data-action="google-analytics#accept">
      Aceitar métricas
    </button>
  </div>
</aside>
